otel-reserv-geo-mongo}: Pulling image "mongo:8.0.14-rc0"\n', id='5e20cb7e-d047-494e-8053-aafa2f3a130e', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-b02865cfbddc7fca'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='487f670a-63da-4fbe-8c8c-c03b2c7e8ceb')]]
